By way of filing the present criminal misc. petition under Section 528 BNSS, the petitioner has prayed for the following reliefs:-
"It is, therefore most respectfully prayed that the criminal misc. petition filed by the petitioner may kindly be allowed and:
(i) the concerned Regional Passport Authority may kindly be directed to issue a passport with the standard validity period of 10 years to the petitioner;
(ii) the passport of the petitioner Dinesh Bhambhani may kindly be renewed for a period of 10 years;
(iii) Any other appropriate order or directions which may be deemed just and proper in the facts and circumstances of the case my also be passed in favour of the petitioner."
